OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Kay bomb hoax case postponed
OL,4,Auntil next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case against a man charged over an
OL,7,Falleged bomb hoax at a Peter Kay
OL,8,Fperformance has been postponed until
OL,9,Fnext May.
OL,11,FOmar Majed, 20, who has yet to enter a
OL,12,Fplea, appeared at Birmingham Crown
OL,13,FCourt via video-link from hospital,
OL,14,Fafter being charged with communicating
OL,15,Ffalse information to police contrary to
OL,16,Fthe Criminal Law Act.
OL,18,FIt follows the evacuation of the
OL,19,FUtilita Arena in Birmingham during a
OL,20,Fshow by comedian Kay on 1 May, to allow
OL,21,Fpolice to carry out searches.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
