OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Kay bomb hoax case postponed
OL,4,Auntil next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FKay was ushered off the stage about 45
OL,7,Fminutes into his set and thousands of
OL,8,Ffans were told to leave the arena as
OL,9,Fthe show had been abruptly cancelled.
